his grasp.\n\nSince then, the balance of the universe has been lost with no one to challenge the Great God\u2019s will or temper his petty whims. It\u2019s time for that to change. \n\nBut to overthrow the godhead, you must amass your own power. Topple the great Titans, \ndestroy the vile demi-gods and slaughter mass hordes to challenge Olympus. For the sake of mortals and gods alike.\n\nWill you fulfill your destiny?", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a relentless battleground of mythical hordes, divine chaos and epic landscapes. Challenge heroes to gain skills, hone divine powers and take your seat as a god.  Will you rise to the occasion, chosen one? Your odyssey has only just begun."}]}, "developer_name": "Avrio Analytics", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://retrogodz.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://retrogodz.com/user-license-agreement", "publisher_name": "RetroGodz", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.retrogodz.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9062052053846508"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75443235_911369684027974_213786881953061535_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dqse6LiPgUcQ7kNvwHuCumZ&_nc_oc=Adn54BoveZ25yrS40k